{"id":"02536e2efd437c59","group":"89","path":"89/89-df-fixed-point-modal.md","title":"Modal Fixed-Point Set","display":"df-fixed-point-modal — Modal Fixed-Point Set","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-df-fixed-point-modal","aliases":["89-df-fixed-point-modal"],"display":"df-fixed-point-modal — Modal Fixed-Point Set","depends_on":["[[89-df-fixed-point]]","[[89-df-modalized-formula]]","[[89-df-gl-logic]]","[[89-lem-fixed-point-strong-equivalence]]"],"revised":"2026-10-05"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-df-fixed-point-modal"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-df-fixed-point-modal</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-fixed-point-modal — Modal Fixed-Point Set"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"85e306b51d3267ec\" href=\"?note=85e306b51d3267ec\" title=\"89-df-fixed-point\">89-df-fixed-point</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d8f6cb40eba269af\" href=\"?note=d8f6cb40eba269af\" title=\"89-df-modalized-formula\">89-df-modalized-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"0006800fa1c85177\" href=\"?note=0006800fa1c85177\" title=\"89-df-gl-logic\">89-df-gl-logic</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"426d9ae12ef39fe8\" href=\"?note=426d9ae12ef39fe8\" title=\"89-lem-fixed-point-strong-equivalence\">89-lem-fixed-point-strong-equivalence</a></span></div>"},{"key":"revised","html":"2026-10-05"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\\in\\mathrm{Prop}\">\\(p\\in\\mathrm{Prop}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathcal M_{\\Box,p}\">\\(A\\in\\mathcal M_{\\Box,p}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GL}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\">\\(\\mathrm{GL}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Fix}_{\\mathrm{GL}}\">\\(\\mathrm{Fix}_{\\mathrm{GL}}\\)</span> 是既有弱不动点谓词；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MFix}_{\\mathrm{GL}}(A,p)\">\\(\\mathrm{MFix}_{\\mathrm{GL}}(A,p)\\)</span> 为下文定义的集合。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}fixed\\text{-}point\\text{-}modal}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{MFix}_{\\mathrm{GL}}(A,p)\\coloneqq\n\\{B\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\mid\\mathrm{Fix}_{\\mathrm{GL}}(A,p,B)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}fixed\\text{-}point\\text{-}modal}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{MFix}_{\\mathrm{GL}}(A,p)\\coloneqq\n\\{B\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\mid\\mathrm{Fix}_{\\mathrm{GL}}(A,p,B)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>来源：Boolos, <em>The Logic of Provability</em>，印刷页 104；对应 PDF 页为印刷页加 39。</p>\n<p>幂集分离得到集合；非空与唯一性不是此定义的前提。由于当前 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 明确关于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\">\\(p\\)</span> 模态化，弱/加强等价引理允许把集合中的每个成员读作 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BFix}_{\\mathrm{GL}}\">\\(\\mathrm{BFix}_{\\mathrm{GL}}\\)</span> 成员。该集合允许候选包含其他字母；原书“无新增字母”的选择由 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BookFix}\">\\(\\mathrm{BookFix}\\)</span> 与存在构造保证，不能把语法字母限制偷偷添加到旧集合中。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-fixed-point","status":"resolved","id":"85e306b51d3267ec","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-fixed-point]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-modalized-formula","status":"resolved","id":"d8f6cb40eba269af","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-modalized-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-gl-logic","status":"resolved","id":"0006800fa1c85177","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-gl-logic]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-lem-fixed-point-strong-equivalence","status":"resolved","id":"426d9ae12ef39fe8","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-lem-fixed-point-strong-equivalence]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"p\\in\\mathrm{Prop}","display":false},{"tex":"A\\in\\mathcal M_{\\Box,p}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{GL}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Fix}_{\\mathrm{GL}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{MFix}_{\\mathrm{GL}}(A,p)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}fixed\\text{-}point\\text{-}modal}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{MFix}_{\\mathrm{GL}}(A,p)\\coloneqq\n\\{B\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\mid\\mathrm{Fix}_{\\mathrm{GL}}(A,p,B)\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"p","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{BFix}_{\\mathrm{GL}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{BookFix}","display":false}],"bytes":1348,"backlinks":[{"id":"d5d0908b482e31f2","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"8595a46bd83435a9","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"728ff257684515d2","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"1cd2a39dee160249","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"03089c3cefed4872","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"d02a2af901e8720d","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"a74a9caa29e2a312","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"